      "en": "When the disciples heard it, they fell on their faces, and were very afraid.",
      "ko": "제자들이 듣고 엎드리어 심히 두려워하니",
      "source_text_hash": "2fe8154fc2c6220312ea94cfae1805ceb7a99d035709a03dd8fbee0db76213e2",
