      "en": "He said to them, “Because of your unbelief. For most certainly I tell you, if you have faith as a grain of mustard seed, you will tell this mountain, ‘Move from here to there,’ and it will move; and nothing will be impossible for you.",
      "ko": "가라사대 너희 믿음이 적은 연고니라 진실로 너희에게 이르노니 너희가 만일 믿음이 한 겨자씨만큼만 있으면 이 산을 명하여 여기서 저기로 옮기라 하여도 옮길 것이요 또 너희가 못할 것이 없으리라",
      "source_text_hash": "3b2d31785c1f19b8286a8d9f63ed4b0640a04d70ee93dbf11158b10c1ac1ae13",
      "translation_text_hash": "2b16b280e9dbd71fb0aabdc8e7956bac1465abb6c64b3503da538f20639ec38a",
